<view class="screen"><view class="profile-header"><view class="profile-avatar">习</view><view><view class="profile-title">你好，学习者</view><view class="profile-subtitle">今天的积累，都是明天的底气。</view></view></view><view class="local-badge">本地访客 · 无需授权即可体验</view><view class="profile-stats"><view><text>{{history.length}}</text><view>完成练习</view></view><view><text>{{answered}}</text><view>累计答题</view></view><view><text>{{correct}}</text><view>累计答对</view></view></view><view class="profile-preview-entry" bindtap="preview"><view><view>页面展示预览</view><text>切换首页图文与内容加载场景</text></view><text>›</text></view><view class="section-heading"><text class="section-title">我的练习记录</text><text wx:if="{{history.length}}" class="section-link" bindtap="reset">清空记录</text></view><view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" class="card history-card"><view><view class="history-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="history-date">{{item.time}} · 共 {{item.total}} 题，答对 {{item.correct}} 题</view></view><view class="history-score">{{item.accuracy}}<text>%</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!history.length}}" class="card empty"><view class="empty-mark">✦</view><view class="empty-title">留下一次进步的记录</view><view class="empty-desc">完成一组示例练习后，<text>{{'\n'}}</text>你的结果会出现在这里。</view><button class="secondary-button start-button" bindtap="practice">开始练习</button></view><view class="demo-note">当前设备仅保留最近 30 次演示记录<text>{{'\n'}}</text>不上传、不跨设备同步</view></view>

